Title: Evaluating Retrieval Precision with Token F1 and LLM Judges | Authors: Tuan Phan, Mai Bui | Summary: Evaluating open-domain QA requires robust metrics. We benchmark semantic similarity, token-level overlap F1, and model-based judge verdicts to quantify RAG answer correctness across noisy corpus conditions. | Categories: Natural Language Processing, Evaluation Methodology | Published: 2026-0